## Blocking Issues
- **QA9, fixed.** Totals of 1,000,000 or more printed with the separator in the wrong place (`1234,567.00`).
  - Fixed in commit `ae2afb0` (row 1.3 in `tasks.md`).
  - The regression test `test/csvtotal.test.ts::totals of a million or more group every thousand` failed before the fix.
  - The delta review first returned REJECT, only to reject carrying QA1 over unchanged. I re-ran QA1 and it passed; the second review returned OKAY.
- **B1, unfixed and overridden.** `src/money.ts:2` rounds prices with more than two decimals using floating-point arithmetic.
  - The record keeps it with rule `accepted-residual` and disposition `residual`.
  - `override.by` is "Tim", with your reason.

